{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cv8MHj23Z41795574467.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國報告近期有三人感染H5N1高致病性禽流感，其中一人死亡。</p><p></p><p>世界衞生組織表示，患者都在華盛頓州亞基馬縣一個乳牛場工作，該地區近期在乳牛檢測到H5N1，但至今無證據表明存在人傳人。世衞組織評估後認為對一般公眾的風險較低，將繼續密切監測。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.H5N1-1030_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ElenBVnB8z1795574463.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>美國疾病控制及預防中心表示，所有病例均在10月中後報告，其中一人患有基礎疾病，10月底出現呼吸道症狀，入院治療但本月初逝世。其餘兩宗確診病例已經康復。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T03:03:53.790081+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T01:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:57:18.520414+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T02:57:18.790444+00:00","content_hash":"efc3b02cbdf1d6bb207d339d01de0c2063c5c62d6dfd4fbc4f713f273c95236c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}